Although Korean home shopping market has short history, it has been continuously&#xD;
showing rapid growth since its foundation in 1995 and declined its growth rate&#xD;
down to single digit compared to previous success record in 2010. Home shopping&#xD;
is indicated by total sales volume of goods sold over broadcasting by the business&#xD;
owner and it is possible to growth rate of TV Home Shopping market of the&#xD;
country based on total trade volume. Even though trade volume for home&#xD;
shopping tend to decline from 2010 to 2015, it shows tendency to grow by 7.7%&#xD;
from last year because sales in abroad impacted to sales of TV Home Shopping&#xD;
market of Korea as it operates in 12 other countries including China, Thailand,&#xD;
India, Indonesia, Vietnam and Taiwan. The operations such as CJ Oshopping, GS&#xD;
home shopping , lotte home shopping, Hyundai home shopping in China, CJ&#xD;
Oshopping, GS home shopping , lotte home shopping in Thailand, CJ Oshopping,&#xD;
GS home shopping in India, GS home shopping in Indonesia, CJ Oshopping, GS&#xD;
home shopping , lotte home shopping, and Hyundai home shopping in Vietnam&#xD;
respectively.&#xD;
TV home shopping offers (software) program to introduce goods, and show host is&#xD;
responsible for compare and introduce information, weaknesses, advantages of&#xD;
goods on behalf of customers. The survey was conducted by the show host&#xD;
message method using 4 characteristics of price, urgent, scarcity, and term&#xD;
characteristics in order to study impacts for purchasing of customers. The survey&#xD;
